<title>USA: NetChannel to buy Colorocs unit.</title>
<headline>NetChannel to buy Colorocs unit.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetChannel Inc said Monday it had signed a letter of intent to acquire ViewCall America Inc, a majority-owned subsidiary of Colorocs Information Technology Inc.</p>
<p>NetChannel, which makes an Internet and information delivery service for television, did not disclose financial terms of the deal.</p>
<p>&quot;NetChannel and ViewCall America are joining forces to extend our shared vision for a personally relevant consumer Internet TV service,&quot; said Philip Monego Sr, NetChannel's chief executive.  </p>
<p>A definitive agreement is expected later this month and the service is scheduled to launch this summer, the company said.</p>
